## Problem 4: Calculate (1.14 x 10^-62 kg)^3 and 7.7 x 10^-113 / (that cube)

Step 1: Calculate the cube
(1.14 x 10^-62)^3 = (1.14)^3 x (10^-62)^3
                  = 1.482 x 10^-186
                  = **1.48 x 10^-186**

Step 2: Calculate the division
7.7 x 10^-113 / (1.482 x 10^-186)
= (7.7 / 1.482) x 10^(-113-(-186))
= 5.2 x 10^73
= **5.2 x 10^73**

