## Problem 5: Calculate n_0 and a_s

Step 1: Calculate n_0 = 5.4 x 10^25 / (1.14 x 10^-62)
n_0 = (5.4 x 10^25) / (1.14 x 10^-62)
    = (5.4 / 1.14) x 10^(25-(-62))
    = 4.74 x 10^87
    = **4.74 x 10^87**

Step 2: Calculate a_s = 1/(8*pi * n_0 * xi^2)

First, calculate xi^2 = (3.09 x 10^19)^2 = 9.55 x 10^38 m^2

a_s = 1 / (8*pi x n_0 x xi^2)
    = 1 / (8 x 3.14159 x 4.74 x 10^87 x 9.55 x 10^38)
    = 1 / (25.13 x 45.27 x 10^125)
    = 1 / (1137.6 x 10^125)
    = 1 / (1.138 x 10^128)
    = **8.79 x 10^-129 m**

