## Key Finding

The paper appears to have systematic errors in their unit conversions:
1. The mass calculation is off by a factor of 10 (10^-63 vs 10^-62)
2. The eV conversion is off by a factor of 10^4 (10^-23 vs 10^-27)

These errors could significantly impact any derived quantities in the paper.
